1 NAME Ragnhild /Jakhelln/
2 GIVN Ragnhild
2 SURN Jakhelln
2 _MARNM Butenschøn
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norway
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 SEP 1912
