1 NAME Eilert Hagerup /Krog/
2 GIVN Eilert Hagerup
2 SURN Krog
2 _MARNM Krog
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 11 FEB 1746
2 ADDR
3 STAE Buskerud
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 27 FEB 1746
