2 CONT * The baptismal record of their son Peder in 1729 states that Christen Christensen and his wife Maren Madsdatter resided at Harringgaard in Harring parish.
2 CONT * Bef 1727 Christen married Maren Madsdatter, daughter of Mads -sen, in Dueholm Ørum og Vestervig amt, Denmark. Born abt 1700 in Dueholm Ørum og Vestervig amt, Denmark.
