2 NOTE From  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arne_Næs… Wikipedia - Arne Naess Jr]:  “Næss was staying with his friend Johann Rupert on 13 January 2004 when he died in a climbing accident while descending from a peak on Rupert's estate in 
3 CONC the Groot Drakenstein mountains near the town of Franschhoek outside Cape Town, South Africa. According to police reports, Næss' anchoring equipment loosened from the porous mountainside, leading to a 103m fall. He was 66 years ol
3 CONC d.”
