1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her name is Magdalene or Magdalena Irgens per her baptismal and death records--she has an older sister named Gjertrud Irgens.  For some reason their data is often mixed together.  In some documentation she is liste
2 CONC d as Magdalene Bruun Irgens.  Her maternal grandmother was a Bruun.
2 CONT Birth: Dec 8,1760
2 CONT Death: Feb 28, 1838
2 CONT See the Media tab for her baptismal record and her listing from the Irgens Family History book.
