1 NOTE {geni:about_me} attached is Taebring Kirkebog der fortaeller med fuld nekrolog hvordan min 5th grandfather Soeren Jensen - we never could find: Where he is born, married, children everything. I worked 2 years to find this; it is a
2 CONC  big day:  Carl Peter Haraldsoen Madsen November 11, 2013 Toronto Canada.
2 CONT
