2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-562869491-1-500024/christen-friis-daae-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-efa45a1a756e6055cb557abc3669e71c&mrid=709da159ca5f4152bbe794ef909e733b MyHeritag
