1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Http://www.nose.dk/Norge/trane.html 
2 CONT * Stavanger borgerbog side 98 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Stavanger borgerbog side 98'''  Jan Jansen Seehuusen, - uden tvivl søn af Jan Seehuusen fra Bredsted i Holsten som 6. febr. 1665 tog b. i Bergen og 18 sept. 1670 der ægtede Dirichie Engelman -; b. 25 okt., havde tidligere været
2 CONC  toldbetjent. Var skipper og drev handel; begr. 11. aug. 1732.  g. 28. sept. 1702 Johanna Maria Saxe, datter af tolder Peder Pedersen Saxe; boede som enke paa gaarden Furaas; 1739, (g. 1. 20. jul. 1690 kaptein Johan Conrad Hubert,
2 CONC  begr. 4. nov. 1697).
2 CONT
2 CONT Seehuusen Per Helge Seglsten  (View posts)	 Posted:	17 Nov 1999 1:00PM Classification: Query Surnames: Seehuusen, Engelmans I'm looking for information about trader Hans Seehuusen and his wife Catharina Mortensdatter,both born abo
2 CONC ut 1600-1610 in bredsted, Slesvig. Together they had at least one son; Jan (Johan) Seehuusen (born ca. 1640 in Bredsted). Jan (Johan) was married to Dirche Engelmans (born ca. 1650) All hints will be greatly appreciated.
2 CONT
2 CONT Per Helge Seglsten
