1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Peder Rist Dreyer''' was born on January 13, 1833 in Møkland, Bø i Vesterålen, Nordland, Norway. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-38606680 Peder Rist Willatzsen Dreyer] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-39431207 J
2 CONC ochumine Lorentsa Krogh]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peder Rist married [https://www.geni.com/profile-123075467 Elina Helene Dorthea Dreyer (Lagesdatter)] on September 23, 1858 in Øksnes kirke, Øksnes, Nordland, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/2649/17083/1
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-67205610 Antonette Fredrikke Sofie Dreyer]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-123075121 Elise Caroline Jenssen (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67205726 M
2 CONC ina Petrine Emilie Dreyer]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67205781 Barbara Oline Pedersen (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67205862 Petra Jokumine Kristoffersen (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67205945 Mina Petrik
2 CONC ke Emilie Karoliussen (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67205988 Joachim Daniel Peder Dreyer]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-65911558 Olivia Kristine Dreyer Johansen (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-121353271 Laura 
2 CONC Kaspara Jægtnes (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67206179 Hilda Magdalene Eide (Dreyer)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-67091430 Laurits Antoni Dreyer]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 16, 1896 in Møkland, Bø i Vesterålen, Nordland, Norway from Omkom på sjøen and was buried on March 14, 1896. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?idx_kildeid=16732&idx_id=16732&uid=ny&idx_side=-53
2 CONT
