2 NOTE This is a copy of sketch by Johan Lauritz Buaas.  It is  Albrechtsburg Castle in Meissen Germany near the Elbe River--this was presumably done before he came to the USA in 1849. Perhaps done on his "utdanningsreise" or educational
3 CONC  journey in Europe.  The sketch came from Allan K. James, who was the grandson of Adele Buaas--who received it from her mother Helene Buaas after Johan's death.  Allan passed away in Houston in 2002
2 NOTE This looks a bit like the castle mentioned below: 
