2 CONT
2 CONT Maren Abelsdatter BROCH 
2 CONT
2 CONT ABT 1590 - AFT ER 1652
2 CONT
2 CONT RESIDENCE: (hun og sønnen Niels hadde hver 3 våg i Myklebostad) 
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: ABT 1590, Laskestad, Steigen, NO 
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: AFT ER 1652, Myklebostad i Steigen, NO ? 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Abel Michelsen BROCH 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: NN 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Arne OLUFSEN 
2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE: ABT 1608, (?) 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Niels ARNESSØN 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Hartvig ARNESSØN 
